{
  "id": "csw/example/s3-normalization",
  "type": "example",
  "track": "G",
  "title": "$Z(S^3)=S_{00}$ 的数值检验",
  "aliases": [
    "Z(S^3)",
    "三球配分函数"
  ],
  "summary": "$Z(S^3)=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{k+2}}\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{k+2}$：$k=1$ 给 $1/\\sqrt2$，$k=2$ 给 $1/2$。",
  "question": "为什么 $S^3$ 的 CS 配分函数等于 $S_{00}$？用数值检验 $k=1,2$。",
  "concept_refs": [
    "csw/concept/s-matrix",
    "csw/concept/surgery-formula"
  ],
  "setup": "$S^3$ 可看成 $S^2\\times S^1$ 沿边界环面做手术；手术公式给 $Z(S^3)=S_{00}$（乘以适当的标架相位，标准标架下为 1）。",
  "computation": [
    {
      "no": 1,
      "text": "对 $SU(2)_k$，$S_{00}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{k+2}}\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{k+2}$。",
      "why": "$j=l=0$ 代入正弦公式。"
    },
    {
      "no": 2,
      "text": "$k=1$：$\\sqrt{2/3}\\sin(\\pi/3)=\\sqrt{2/3}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt3}2=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}$。",
      "why": "算术。"
    },
    {
      "no": 3,
      "text": "$k=2$：$\\sqrt{2/4}\\sin(\\pi/4)=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2}2=\\frac12$。",
      "why": "算术。"
    }
  ],
  "result": "$Z(S^3)_{k=1}=1/\\sqrt2$，$Z(S^3)_{k=2}=1/2$。",
  "check": "两者都满足 $|Z|\\le1$ 且随 $k$ 增大振荡衰减（半经典极限）。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "常见错误：把 $k=1$ 的 $Z(S^3)$ 写成 $1/2$（那是 $k=2$ 的值）。",
    "标架相位会引入 $e^{2\\pi i\\cdot\\text{标架}\\cdot c/24}$，标准 $S^3$ 取 1。"
  ],
  "related": [
